# Extracted/compiled X4 game data -- not this project's own content, and
# not something to redistribute in bulk via a public repo (see TODO.md's
# "Copyright/attribution notice" section for the reasoning). Regenerable by
# anyone with a legitimate X4 install by running extract_game_data.py then
# generate_ships_table.py against their own copy of the game.
data/
src/csv/*.csv

# Third-party tool, not authored by this project -- see TODO.md's
